title: "UMST Concrete Cartridge: Differentiable Constitutive Engine"
abstract: "The first scientific cartridge for the UMST manifold. Maps topological scalar features into 22 coupled constitutive modules of cementitious materials, providing end-to-end differentiable mix design optimization."
